    "Vane": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vane answers with the Claude Code or Codex command line installed on your Mac. Open Vane on the Mac and ask there: it sees the same numbers as this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane responde con la línea de comandos de Claude Code o Codex instalada en tu Mac. Abre Vane en el Mac y pregunta allí: ve las mismas cifras que este iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane répond avec la ligne de commande Claude Code ou Codex installée sur votre Mac. Ouvrez Vane sur le Mac et posez votre question : elle voit les mêmes chiffres que cet iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane risponde con la riga di comando di Claude Code o Codex installata sul tuo Mac. Apri Vane sul Mac e chiedi lì: vede gli stessi numeri di questo iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vane checks your data after every refresh and lists what's worth knowing here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane revisa tus datos tras cada actualización y lista aquí lo que merece la pena saber."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane vérifie vos données après chaque actualisation et liste ici ce qui mérite votre attention."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane controlla i tuoi dati a ogni aggiornamento ed elenca qui ciò che vale la pena sapere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vane compared %lld metrics with their usual range. Everything is normal, so there is nothing to act on today. New insights appear here when a metric leaves its range or a review needs you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vane compared %lld metric with its usual range. Everything is normal, so there is nothing to act on today. New insights appear here when a metric leaves its range or a review needs you."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vane compared %lld metrics with their usual range. Everything is normal, so there is nothing to act on today. New insights appear here when a metric leaves its range or a review needs you."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane comparó %lld métricas con su rango habitual. Todo es normal, así que hoy no hay nada que hacer. Aquí aparecerán hallazgos nuevos cuando una métrica salga de su rango o una reseña te necesite."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vane a comparé %lld indicateur à sa plage habituelle. Tout est normal, rien à faire aujourd'hui. De nouvelles observations apparaissent ici quand un indicateur sort de sa plage ou qu'un avis attend votre réponse."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Vane a comparé %lld indicateurs à leur plage habituelle. Tout est normal, rien à faire aujourd'hui. De nouvelles observations apparaissent ici quand un indicateur sort de sa plage ou qu'un avis attend votre réponse."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane ha confrontato %lld metriche con il loro intervallo abituale. Tutto è nella norma, quindi oggi non c’è nulla da fare. I nuovi approfondimenti compaiono qui quando una metrica esce dal suo intervallo o una recensione ha bisogno di te."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vane is free. A coffee on Ko-fi keeps it going.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane es gratis. Un café en Ko-fi lo mantiene en marcha."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane est gratuite. Un café sur Ko-fi aide à la faire vivre."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane è gratuita. Un caffè su Ko-fi la fa andare avanti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vane on iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane en el iPhone"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane sur iPhone"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vane su iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vane on the Mac shows the code in Settings → App Store Connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
